> Kamp Kiwanis is a summer camp that[ aims] to[ be] an easily accessible source of summer fun for children with disabilities and special needs. Its main emphasis is[ around] group bonding and teamwork[ (]around 20 per session) and all activites are[ encouraged] in this fashion[,] but no particular act[i]ity is compulsory[.]
